  aciklama:
  - "Magnuskop'u 3 sene sonras\u0131 i\xE7in ayarlad\u0131m {{isim}}. Sol el y\xFCz\xFCk
    parma\u011F\u0131n\u0131 dolu g\xF6r\xFCyorum, evlendin mi acaba? <sprite=85>
    Sa\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131 olduk\xE7a k\u0131sa kestirmi\u015Fsin, g\xF6z\xFCnde
    ise bir g\xF6zl\xFCk var. Numaral\u0131 m\u0131 anlayamad\u0131m. Kar\u015F\u0131nda
    duran senden ya\u015F\xE7a b\xFCy\xFCk erke\u011Fe tek yaprak bir ka\u011F\u0131t
    uzat\u0131yorsun. Uzun y\u0131llard\u0131r \xFCzerinde u\u011Fra\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    mesle\u011Finle ilgili bir i\u015F, o ki\u015Fi taraf\u0131ndan \xE7\xF6z\xFClmek
    \xFCzere gibi..."
